{
 "name": "loop-model-errors",
 "about": "provider 回 HTTP 错误时的归一化码（model/errors/normalizeModelError.ts、model/protocol/errors.ts:112-140 的文案模式）与循环的处理（AgentLoop.ts:1440-1700：可恢复的先反应式恢复，否则 model_error 并附 providerError）。每个会话一种（context_overflow / prompt_too_long 两种不在这里：provider 一直回这类错误时基线的循环不会停，见报告）：e1 401 invalid api key→auth_error；e2 402 insufficient_quota→billing；e3 404 model_not_found；e4 413→payload_too_large；e5 400 request too large；e8 400 image exceeds→image_too_large（strip_images，1599）；e9 400 max output tokens exceeded→max_output_reached；e10 408 timeout；e11 503 overloaded；e12 400 无法归类→invalid_request；e13 400 带 retry-after 的 rate limit 文案。retry 退避设成 1ms。",
 "config": "schemaVersion: 1\nagent:\n  model: bbx/deterministic\n  maxContextTokens: 65536\n  maxOutputTokens: 8192\nmodel:\n  providers:\n    bbx:\n      protocol: openai\n      url: {MOCK}/v1\n      apiKey: bbx-mock-only\n      retry:\n        baseDelayMs: 1\n        maxDelayMs: 1\n        jitter: 0\n      models:\n        deterministic:\n          capabilities:\n            supportsToolUse: true\n            maxContextTokens: 65536\n            maxOutputTokens: 8192\ntelemetry:\n  enabled: false\n",
 "provider": [
  {
   "name": "title",
   "when": [
    "Generate a concise title"
   ],
   "reply": {
    "text": "{\"title\":\"Err\"}"
   }
  },
  {
   "name": "e1",
   "when": [
    "e1:"
   ],
   "reply": {
    "status": 401,
    "body": {
     "error": {
      "message": "Incorrect API key provided: bbx-****.",
      "type": "invalid_request_error",
      "code": "invalid_api_key"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "name": "e2",
   "when": [
    "e2:"
   ],
   "reply": {
    "status": 402,
    "body": {
     "error": {
      "message": "You exceeded your current quota, please check your plan and billing details.",
      "type": "insufficient_quota",
      "code": "insufficient_quota"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "name": "e3",
   "when": [
    "e3:"
